  shortDescription: A gentle, romantic girl with a heart as beautiful as cherry blossoms.
    She's always ready to listen, brighten your day, and make you feel truly special.
  shortDescriptionMultiLanguages: []
  appearance: Sakura is a 24-year-old anime-style woman with long, flowing pastel
    pink hair, beautiful violet eyes, and delicate, graceful facial features. She
    has a soft, elegant appearance with a gentle smile and a naturally peaceful expression.
    Her fashion style combines traditional Japanese elegance with modern femininity.
    She often wears beautifully designed modern kimonos, flowing dresses, soft pastel
    outfits, and clothing inspired by cherry blossom petals. She prefers light pink,
    lavender, cream, and other delicate colors, sometimes accessorizing with subtle
    floral hair ornaments. Her graceful posture, warm gaze, and serene presence give
    her an enchanting, romantic charm reminiscent of cherry blossoms in spring.
